n\[ADoubleDot]ra 1.2, s\[ARing] har derivatan ett nollst\[ADoubleDot]lle. \
Kommandot ",
 StyleBox["FindRoot", "Input"],
 " kan d\[ARing] anv\[ADoubleDot]ndas,\[LineSeparator]f\[ODoubleDot]r att utg\
\[ARing] ifr\[ARing]n 1.2 och leta efter en rot i n\[ADoubleDot]rheten av \
detta v\[ADoubleDot]rde f\[ODoubleDot]r x."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.904883543790638*^9, 3.904883566540951*^9}, {
  3.904883642209202*^9, 3.904883662075696*^9}, {3.905239519475842*^9, 
  3.9052395736659813`*^9}, {3.905239681186803*^9, 3.905239804926321*^9}, {
  3.905239837340577*^9, 
  3.9052398486760693`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"72ea955a-0f9a-4f20-8681-\
354ce8563f95"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"FindRoot", "[", " ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"w", "'"}], "[", "x", "]"}], "==", "0"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"x", ",", "1.2"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.905239812032933*^9, 3.905239868709962*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[15]:=",ExpressionUUID->"660ff4d4-5a0f-46e9-9dcf-2afc5bfb4729"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"x", "\[Rule]", "1.2529726228670157`"}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.905239881703915*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[15]=",ExpressionUUID->"355fe1b0-858b-45f4-8944-f72e9da87b40"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "S\[ADoubleDot]tt in detta v\[ADoubleDot]rde i ",
 StyleBox["w\[CloseCurlyQuote](x), och verifiera att detta \[ADoubleDot]r n\
