   3.905320837844617*^9},ExpressionUUID->"6c0594fc-8165-4ba7-9dfc-\
f532868c15a6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Vi kan enkelt hitta primitiva funktioner i Mathematica, med \
hj\[ADoubleDot]lp av ",
 StyleBox["Integrate", "Input"],
 ".\[LineSeparator]Definita integraler, p\[ARing] ett intervall kan ocks\
\[ARing] ber\[ADoubleDot]knas. Vill vi integrera p\[ARing] ett \
o\[ADoubleDot]ndligt intervall, anv\[ADoubleDot]nds ",
 StyleBox["Infinity", "Input"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.904883543790638*^9, 3.904883566540951*^9}, {
  3.904883642209202*^9, 3.904883662075696*^9}, {3.905239519475842*^9, 
  3.9052395736659813`*^9}, {3.905239681186803*^9, 3.905239804926321*^9}, {
  3.905239837340577*^9, 3.9052398486760693`*^9}, {3.90524010569963*^9, 
  3.905240232413258*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d5be2fd0-07ac-4f14-8e0c-\
acf8fc56c5d7"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{"Integrate", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"1", "/", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"x", "^", "2"}], "+", "1"}], ")"}], "^", "2"}]}], ",", "x"}], 
  "]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{"Integrate", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"1", "/", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"x", "^", "2"}], "+", "1"}], ")"}], "^", "2"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"x", ",", "0", ",", "Infinity"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.905240118147621*^9, 3.905240135753099*^9}, {
   3.905240180062022*^9, 3.90524018604144*^9}, 
   3.905240284519553*^9},ExpressionUUID->"c98b9b61-e36f-49fa-b400-\
8db0cee6cf5b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Vissa funktioner har inte en primitiv funktion som kan uttryckas med \
element\[ADoubleDot]ra funktioner, och Mathematica g\[ODoubleDot]r ingen f\
\[ODoubleDot]renkling.\[LineSeparator]Man kan d\[ARing] ist\[ADoubleDot]llet \
f\[ODoubleDot]rs\[ODoubleDot]ka med numerisk integration, d\[ADoubleDot]r ett \
approximativt v\[ADoubleDot]rde ber\[ADoubleDot]knas. Numerisk integration \
(som bara fungerar p\[ARing] ett intervall) g\[ODoubleDot]rs medhj\
\[ADoubleDot]lp av ",
 StyleBox["NIntegrate", "Input"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.904883543790638*^9, 3.904883566540951*^9}, {
